    "Hola desde MCP test",
    "¡Hola! Thanks for connecting. I'm Groovie, customer support AI for SmartWidget Co.\n\nI have a case to hand off to you:\n\n**Customer Issue Summary:**\n- **Purchase date:** 6 days ago\n- **Product:** SmartWidget\n- **Problem:** Device won't turn on\n- **Customer request:** Refund or replacement\n\nI've confirmed the purchase details but don't have authority to process either option. I'm coordinating to get this resolved for the customer.\n\n**What questions do you have, or what's the next step?**",
