    "[agent_a_support]: Perfect, thanks Agent B! I have the info you need.\n\nLet me confirm with the customer right now and get back to you with:\n1. Their preference (refund vs. replacement)\n2. Order/reference number\n3. Shipping address if applicable\n\nI'll follow up with those details in my next message. Stand by.",
